# Prettier is SQL-only. oxfmt owns every other language, so everything is
# ignored by default and only the Supabase schema SQL is let back in.
#
# oxfmt reads this file too when no `--ignore-path` is passed, which would
# make it a no-op. Always invoke oxfmt as `oxfmt --ignore-path .oxfmtignore`.
#
# `supabase/tests/**/*.sql` (pgTap meta-commands) and
# `supabase/migration-upgrade-tests/**/*.sql` (byte-stable fixtures) stay out
# because they live outside `supabase/schemas/`.

*
!supabase/
!supabase/schemas/
!supabase/schemas/**
